<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">{!Lead.FirstName},</font><div style=""><br><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">As promised, here is contact info for one of best lenders. Your next step is to complete the online application for financing. Once you are pre-approved, we will be ready to start building your portfolio together.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style=""><br><font color="#3333ff"><b><u>Please use the link included in Anthony DiToma's contact info</u></b></font> below and complete the application. Anthony's team will reach out to you within 48 hours of receiving your application to introduce themselves and help you obtain the financing approval.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Let me know as soon as you receive your approval for financing, and schedule a call with me using the link in my email as soon you are approved so that we can begin review properties as the become available.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Thanks,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">David&nbsp;</div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12.8px; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><font size="4" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: &quot;Britannic Bold&quot;, sans-serif;">Anthony&nbsp;<span class="il" style="">DiToma</span></span><span style="font-family: &quot;Britannic Bold&quot;, sans-serif;"><u></u><u></u></span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Britannic Bold&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="4">Loan Officer – NMLS #13002<u></u><u></u></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><b><font size="4" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000"><a href="tel:(972)%20447-5694" value="+19724475694" target="_blank" style="">972-447-5694</a>&nbsp;</font>– Direct<u></u><u></u></font></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><b><font size="4" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="tel:(903)%20421-1264" value="+19034211264" target="_blank" style="">903-421-1264</a>&nbsp;– Cell<u></u><u></u></font></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><b><font size="4" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="tel:(469)%20461-1356" value="+14694611356" target="_blank" style="">469-461-1356</a>&nbsp;– Fax<u></u><u></u></font></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Britannic Bold&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="4">14841 N. Dallas Pkwy - Suite 250 Dallas, TX 75254<u></u><u></u></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><a href="mailto:anthony.ditoma@supremelending.com" target="_blank" style=""><font size="4" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);" color="#000000">anthony.<span class="il" style="">ditoma</span>@supremelending.<wbr>com</font></a><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12.8px;"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12.8px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://anthonyditoma.supremelending.com/" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=http://anthonyditoma.supremelending.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1511038774908000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEcX0y5eQ9TfMJR0mID8rs43r78Ig" style=""><font color="#3366ff" style="" size="5">http://anthonyditoma.<wbr>supremelending.com</font></a></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12.8px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);"><br></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12.8px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></p><div class="gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature" style="font-size: small; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><br class="Apple-interchange-newline"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">--&nbsp;</span><br><div class="gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div style="border-collapse: separate; font-family: georgia, serif;"><br><div dir="ltr" style="margin-left: 1.5pt;"><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
